type: software
title: "SETI Repeater Pipeline"
abstract: >-
  A transparent, preregistered multi-epoch search for intermittent narrowband
  signals that become coherent under selected exoplanet motion hypotheses,
  with empirical global calibration, ON/OFF controls, reproducible public-data
  extraction, and labelled candidate follow-up.
